						 <p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-right: 6px;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">1. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">관련</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">학생성공개발원행정실</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">-1550(2026.9.21.)</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.2pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">2. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;">우리 대학 재학생의 지역기업 인식 개선부터 기업가치 재발견</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;">직무 탐색 및 채용 연계로 이어지는 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;">학생성공</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;">(Student Success)</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">을 위한 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">「</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">가장 일하고 싶은 지역기업 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">TOP10</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">」</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">공모전을 개최하오니</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">많은 학생들이 참여할 수 있도록 적극 안내하여 주시길 바랍니다</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;">.</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 106px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -80.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">가</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">공모전명</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">「</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">가장 일하고 싶은 지역기업 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">TOP10</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">」</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">공모전</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">나</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">신청대상</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">전체 대학 전학년 재학생 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">100</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">명</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">(5</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">명</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">&times;20</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">팀</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">다</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">신청기간</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">~ 10. 7.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">수</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">) 16:00</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">※</span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">마감기한 엄수</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">라</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">신청방법</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">아래 서류 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">가지를 신청기간 내 이메일 제출</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">([email-redacted])</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">붙임 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">1. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">참가신청서</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">스캔본</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">※</span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">원본파일</span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">서명포함</span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">은 기간 내 문창회관 </span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">층 현장실습지원센터로 제출</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">붙임 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">2. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">연구계획서</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">재학증명서</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">(5</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">인</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">※ </span><span style="font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9pt;">공모전 기간 내 재학 신분 유지</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">마</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">. </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">시상내역</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"><br></p>
