<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 11pt;">공모작은 학생성공개발원 홈페이지나 지역기업 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 11pt;">TOP10 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 11pt;">모음집</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 11pt;">백서</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 11pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 11pt;">에 공개될 수 있음</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 9pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 9pt;">개인 신상정보 비공개</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 9pt;">)</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%; margin-left: 21px; margin-right: 6px; text-indent: -15.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;">자세한 내용은 부산대학교 공식 홈페이지 또는 학생성공개발원 공지사항 참고</span></p>
